  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Colleen Malone**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **I've Been All Around This World**: back after 203 archived shows (1259 days); rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Dark Hollow**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Life to Go**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Red Haired Boy**: back after 412 archived shows (2750 days); rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **Old Man at the Mill**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-12-09.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 26 songs; 133 min [1]\n- **billystrings2022-12-09.Litz.ScheopsMK41.Flac24**: source not stated; 26 songs; 133 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Andy Lytle was the front-of-house sound engineer for the show [1]\n- Andy Lytle was the front-of-house sound engineer for the show [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-12-09.Litz.SchoepsMK41.Flac16**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY250/5i>Baby NBox>Sony PCM-A10 [1]. Also: Transfer went from SD card through Audacity (slight amplification, dither to 16-bit, normalize), CD Wave, then Foobar2000 tagging; Rich Stoler processed it [1]\n- **billystrings2022-12-09.Litz.ScheopsMK41.Flac24**: taped by Keith Litzenberger; transferred by Rich Stoler; source: Schoeps MK41v's>Schoeps KCY250/5i>Baby NBox>Sony PCM-A10 [2]. Also: Transfer went from SD card through Audacity (slight amplification, normalize, no dithering), CD Wave, then Foobar2000 tagging; Rich Stoler processed it [2]",
